WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.493
PostgreSQL 18: UPSERT va MERGE amaliyoti

00:12.493 --> 00:24.350
INSERT ON CONFLICT va hisoblagich

00:24.350 --> 00:35.832
EXCLUDED bilan ko‘p qatorli yangilash

00:35.832 --> 00:46.901
Konflikt maqsadi va qat’iy qoidalar

00:46.901 --> 00:58.437
MERGE INTO: Uchta amal bitta so‘rovda

00:58.437 --> 01:11.580
Xulosa
